### ==========================================================
### MicrocreditosBX API - Pruebas con Thunder Client
### Extension: Thunder Client (VS Code)
### ==========================================================
### Sustituye correo / cedula por valores nuevos cada vez
### que pruebes el registro (son UNIQUE en la base de datos).
### ==========================================================


# @name baseUrl
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

# El login guarda el token aqui automaticamente
@token =SIN_TOKEN


### ------------------------------------------------------------
### 1. REGISTRO - Crear usuario (publica, con bcrypt)
### Guarda la contrasena hasheada con bcrypt, nunca en texto plano
### ------------------------------------------------------------
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Isaac",
  "apellido": "Cruz Barrero",
  "cedula": "12345678910",
  "correo": "isaac777@gmail.com",
  "contrasena": "12345678910",
  "telefono": "3155141948"
}


### ------------------------------------------------------------
### 2. REGISTRO DUPLICADO - Debe responder 409
### ------------------------------------------------------------
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Isaac",
  "apellido": "Cruz Barrero",
  "cedula": "12345678910",
  "correo": "isaac777@gmail.com",
  "contrasena": "12345678910",
  "telefono": "3155141948"
}


### ------------------------------------------------------------
### 3. REGISTRO SIN DATOS - Debe responder 400
### ------------------------------------------------------------
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Sin datos"
}


### ------------------------------------------------------------
### 4. LOGIN - Devuelve el token JWT
### Ejecuta esta request DESPUES de la #1 y el token
### se guarda solo en {{token}} para las pruebas privadas
### ------------------------------------------------------------
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "correo": "isaac777@gmail.com",
  "contrasena": "12345678910"
}

> {% client.global.set("token", response.body.token); %}


### ------------------------------------------------------------
### 5. LOGIN CON CLAVE INCORRECTA - Debe responder 401
### ------------------------------------------------------------
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "correo": "isaac777@gmail.com",
  "contrasena": "claveIncorrecta"
}


### ------------------------------------------------------------
### 6. MI PERFIL - Ruta PRIVADA (requiere el token del login)
### ------------------------------------------------------------
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ------------------------------------------------------------
### 7. MI PERFIL SIN TOKEN - Debe responder 403
### ------------------------------------------------------------
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me


### ------------------------------------------------------------
### 8. RUTA PROTEGIDA - Usa el token para acceder a /admin
### ------------------------------------------------------------
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/usuarios
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ------------------------------------------------------------
### RUTAS ANTIGUAS (siguen funcionando, misma logica bcrypt + JWT)
### ------------------------------------------------------------

### 9. Registro antiguo
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/registro
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Laura",
  "apellido": "Gomez",
  "cedula": "10987654321",
  "correo": "laura.gomez@gmail.com",
  "contrasena": "claveSegura123",
  "telefono": "3001112233"
}


### 10. Login antiguo
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "correo": "laura.gomez@gmail.com",
  "contrasena": "claveSegura123"
}


### ------------------------------------------------------------
### 11. Health check
### ------------------------------------------------------------
GET {{baseUrl}}/